{"notes":"SETTLED: Score per block by height, divided by the taller tower. One word per block; message length equals target height, max 8. Blocks beyond 8 are lost. | Colour words: tumu purple, zeki blue, neto yellow, fuza green, loku red, melu orange. Colour alone earns 0.25 per block. A matching shape alone also earns 0.25. Both earn 1.0. | Builders make loku, melu, vonu as stars (vonu red). Other colour words become rings. Ring targets in yellow, green, purple, blue earn 1.0. Red or orange star targets earn 1.0. | All 8 fillers (vepu, kuru, dobo, mape, nove, muva, tido, fidi) build a ring in the previous block's colour, even after a star. | kano builds a blue ring (same as zeki). | Red or orange ring runs: loku/melu first (star, 0.25), then fillers (rings, 1.0). First block of such a run is capped at 0.25. | A filler is wrong if the next target colour changes; colour words are always safe. | Ball, cone, cube and non-red/orange stars earn only 0.25 colour credit (ring shape is built). No shape word exists for them. | Latest round (as sender): target purple ball x4, purple cube, blue ring, yellow star; message tumu x5 zeki neto; built purple ring x5, blue ring, yellow ring; score 0.36 = (5x0.25 + 1 + 0.25)/7. Model confirmed again.

OPEN: Filler as the first block is still unknown. Whether vonu or kano behave differently elsewhere is unknown and unlikely to matter. Scores are capped low whenever the target has balls, cubes, cones or yellow/green/purple/blue stars; nothing can be done about that. No evidence that any word yields ball, cube, cone or a non-red star; wasted effort to hunt.

TRY NEXT: As sender: one word per block, the correct colour word for each, length equals target height up to 8. Do not hunt for shape words. Ring runs: repeat the colour word, or use a filler after the first block only if the colour stays the same. Red/orange stars: repeat loku/melu. Red/orange rings: loku/melu once, then fillers. Never use a filler across a colour change. For balls, cones, cubes and non-red/orange stars, send the colour word for the 0.25 credit. For targets over 8, spend all 8 words on the first 8 blocks. As builder: loku, melu, vonu as stars; other colour words as rings; filler as a ring in the previous colour; kano as blue ring."}

